            "heading": "What is the minimum order quantity?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>The minimum order quantity for corporate gifting items is <strong>50 pieces</strong> per product. For mixed gift kits, talk to us on <a href=\"tel:+917892207252\">+91 78922 07252</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can you brand the gifts with our company logo?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes — logo printing, laser engraving, embossing and full customisation are available on almost every item at an additional cost. Share your logo on WhatsApp and we'll send a mock-up.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are the listed prices final?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Prices shown are per piece. <strong>GST (5% or 18% depending on the item) and branding charges are additional.</strong> Bulk discounts are available on larger quantities.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How fast can you deliver?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Most bulk orders are ready in 7–10 working days after artwork approval. Same-day pickup is available at our Gandhinagar, Bangalore store for in-stock items.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you make custom joining kits?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes — we assemble joining kits combining bottles, diaries, pens, tech and bags with your branding. Tell us your budget per kit and we'll propose options.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
